      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "235cc7ea408b.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_biccuri02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "先日、SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんであったリリース記念イベントの前に都内のお店にご挨拶にいってきました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "前几天，在涩谷 TSUTAYA 举办发售纪念活动之前，我先去东京都内的各家店铺打了招呼。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The other day, before the release commemoration event at SHIBUYA TSUTAYA, I went around to stores in Tokyo to say hello."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "CDを手にとってくださった瞬間を目撃したり、鹿乃か？鹿乃なのか？て気付いて声をかけてくれた人にコミュ障っぷりをお披露目したり…うぐぐぐ。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我亲眼看到有人拿起 CD 的瞬间，也有人认出“是鹿乃吗？真的是鹿乃？”而主动跟我搭话，让我当场暴露了不擅交际的一面……呜呜呜。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I witnessed the moment someone picked up my CD, and I showed off my social awkwardness to people who noticed me and asked \"Kano? Is that Kano?\" and spoke to me... ughhh."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "da68ef860456.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/c/d/cd06defe.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "8d254d458dd4.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/a/f/afbc022d.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そんなこんなが色々がありつつ、"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "就这样，在发生了各种各样的事情之后，"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anyway, with all of that going on,"
            }
          ]
        ]
