            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさま"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "涩谷 TSUTAYA"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SHIBUYA TSUTAYA"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "にお邪魔させていただいてきたのですが、どの店舗さまも素敵にどかーんと「ディアブレイブ」をディスプレイしてくださっていて嬉しかったです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我登门拜访了以上这些店铺，每家店都把《Dear Brave》漂亮又醒目地陈列出来，看到时特别开心。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I got to visit all of these, and every single store had put up a wonderful, bold display of \"Dear brave\", which made me so happy."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お店にご挨拶している間にもツイッターでリプライや画像やRTやふぁぼや、色んな形でおめでとうや応援や元気をもらいました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在去各家店铺打招呼期间，我也在 Twitter 上收到了大家的回复、图片、转发和点赞，以各种各样的形式收获了祝贺、应援和元气。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Even while I was visiting the stores, I received congratulations, support and energy in all kinds of forms on Twitter: replies, pictures, RTs, favs and more."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "リリース記念イベントにも足元が悪い中、駆けつけてくださって「おめでとう」を言いにきてもらえて、なんて言葉にすると一番いいんですかね？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "发售纪念活动当天，尽管路不好走，大家还是专程赶来对我说“恭喜”，这份心意该用什么话来表达才最合适呢？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "At the release commemoration event too, you came out despite the bad weather underfoot to say \"congratulations\" to me, and what's the best way to put that into words?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃はめちゃめちゃ幸せものですね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹿乃真是个幸福得不得了的人呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Kano is such a lucky person."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ですかね？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是吧？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Isn't she?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "たくさんの人に支えてもらってるな〜と、特に肌で感じた一日でした。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那一天，我格外真切地感受到“原来有这么多人在支持着我呀”。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It was a day when I especially felt, physically, how many people are supporting me."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本当にありがとうございました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "真的非常感谢大家。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you so much, really."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さて、最後にお知らせです！！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好了，最后是通知！！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now, one last announcement!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今日、11/20の21時より"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天 11/20 晚上 9 点起，"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Today, 11/20, from 9 p.m."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃（カノ）生出演 2ndシングル発売をみんなでお祝いしようスペシャル "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "鹿乃（Kano）现场出演“大家一起庆祝第二张单曲发售”特别节目 "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Kano (Kano) live appearance: Let's All Celebrate the Release of the 2nd Single Special "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "http://nico.ms/lv241808897"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "が！！あります。わああ拍手ー！！ぜひ遊びにではなく助けに（←重要です）きてください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这个节目有哦！！哇啊鼓掌——！！请大家务必前来，不是来玩，而是来帮我（←这一点很重要）。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's happening!! Waaah, applause!! Please come not to hang out but to help me (<- this is important)."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1stシングルのときもね、緊張してね、というかいつでもどこでも緊張と不安でパーンしていてね。みんなのコメントで私に癒しと安らぎと落ち着きをプレゼントしてください。めっちゃお待ちしております！！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "出第一张单曲时也是这样，我很紧张——不如说，无论何时何地我都紧张不安得快炸掉了。请大家用评论给我送上治愈、安宁和平静吧。我超级期待！！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It was the same with my 1st single: I get nervous, or rather, I'm always, everywhere, bursting with nervousness and anxiety. Please give me healing, calm and composure with your comments. I'm really looking forward to having you there!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そしてそして、明日の11月21日は名古屋、大阪日でリリース記念イベントがあります。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还有还有，明天11月21日，在名古屋和大阪也有发售纪念活动。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And also, tomorrow, November 21, there are release commemoration events in Nagoya and Osaka."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "↓ 参加券頒布店舗さま一覧 ↓"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "↓ 发放参加券的店铺一览 ↓"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "↓ List of stores distributing participation tickets ↓"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "・アニメイト名古屋、栄店さん"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "・Animate 名古屋、荣店"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "・Animate Nagoya, Sakae"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "・アニメイト大阪日本橋店、天王寺、三宮、京都、梅田店さん"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "・Animate 大阪日本桥店、天王寺、三宫、京都、梅田店"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "・Animate Osaka Nipponbashi, Tennoji, Sannomiya, Kyoto, Umeda"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まだ参加券が若干あるようなので是非、このブログをみた名古屋、大阪近辺在住、もしくは遠出して行っちゃうぞー！と思ってくださった皆様！！！ぜひ遊びにきてください。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "听说参加券还剩一些，所以——住在名古屋、大阪附近，或是看到这篇博客后心想“那就干脆出趟远门过去吧！”的各位！！！请一定要来玩哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It seems there are still a few participation tickets left, so everyone who read this blog and lives around Nagoya or Osaka, or who thinks \"I'll make the trip there!\", please come and hang out with me!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "詳細はオフィシャルページのイベント情報を参照してくださいっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "详情请参考官网的活动信息页面。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For details, please see the event information on the official page!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://whv-amusic.com/kano/sp/",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "http://whv-amusic.com/kano/sp/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ではでは、鹿乃でしたー！"
          }
        ],
